[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707184016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103164#issuecomment-2707184016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103164","id":2707184016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hXFmQ","user":{"login":"andyprice","id":133737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzczNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice","html_url":"https://github.com/andyprice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T18:53:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T18:53:38Z","body":"I added `print(event)` to the `_input()` function in the MRP. Here is the output **when the right shift key is held** and the left shift key is pressed:\n\nWith the Linux build:\n\n`InputEventKey: keycode=4194325 (Shift), mods=Shift, physical=false, location=left, pressed=true, echo=true`\n\nWith the Windows build (under wine):\n\n`InputEventKey: keycode=4194325 (Shift), mods=none, physical=false, location=left, pressed=true, echo=false`\n\nSo there's a difference in how the two builds consider whether the shift modifier is active and whether the event is an echo.\n\nSo the question is, which build is correct about the echo and modifier states?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707184016/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707215671","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103164#issuecomment-2707215671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103164","id":2707215671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hXNU3","user":{"login":"andyprice","id":133737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzczNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice","html_url":"https://github.com/andyprice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T19:11:31Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T19:11:31Z","body":"To make things even more interesting, it's different still with the Linux build with `--display-driver wayland`:\n\n`InputEventKey: keycode=4194325 (Shift), mods=Shift, physical=false, location=left, pressed=true, echo=false`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707215671/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708195750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103164#issuecomment-2708195750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103164","id":2708195750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ha8mm","user":{"login":"andyprice","id":133737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzczNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice","html_url":"https://github.com/andyprice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T10:39:20Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T10:39:20Z","body":"I did a little study to see the modifier handling differences between the different platforms. The test just has a Control node with a script:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tprint(event)\n```\nResults:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f33458b8-6196-417a-b0f7-4027fbff0da1)\n\nI should note that on the first press of a key while the other is held, X11 registers an echo but on subsequent presses it doesn't. That doesn't happen with `--display-server wayland`\n\n(Mac was omitted as I don't have access to one but perhaps somebody could fill in that column.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708195750/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]